course: dictionary
lesson: 141
title: A name that is also a describing word
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Some words are names. The Aegean is the name of a sea, so it begins with a capital letter, just like London or the Nile. Aegean can also describe things, as in Aegean islands. Context shows you which job the word is doing.
explain: «The Dardanelles links the Sea of Marmara to the Aegean, a part of the Mediterranean.» The clue is «a part of the Mediterranean»: the Aegean is a sea inside a bigger sea. Since it is a name, it has a capital letter.
explain: A quick check: if you can put «the» in front and it names a place, it is a name. If it tells you what kind of thing something is, as in Aegean islands, it is a describing word. Swap in your meaning and see if the sentence still makes sense.
fact: The Aegean is a sea in the Mediterranean, between Greece and Turkey.
fact: The Aegean Sea has many islands, so people often talk about Aegean islands.
fact: Aegean is a proper noun when it names the sea, so it always starts with a capital letter.
fact: Aegean can also be an adjective, describing things from that area, such as Aegean peoples.
fact: «The Dardanelles» is a waterway that joins the Sea of Marmara to the Aegean.
exercise: «The Dardanelles links the Sea of Marmara to the Aegean.» What is the Aegean? | A large city in Greece | A mountain in Turkey | *A sea between Greece and Turkey | A type of ship
exercise: In the phrase «Aegean islands», what does Aegean do? | It is a number | *It describes the islands, telling you where they are | It is the name of a river | It means very small
exercise: Why does Aegean start with a capital letter in «the Aegean»? | It starts a new sentence | It is a German word | Capitals are used for every describing word | *It is the name of a sea
test: «The Dardanelles links the Sea of Marmara to the Aegean, a part of the Mediterranean.» What is the Aegean a part of? | Greece | The Sea of Marmara | The Black Sea | *The Mediterranean
test: Which clue in the sentence tells you the Aegean is a sea? | The word Dardanelles | The word links | *A part of the Mediterranean | The word to
exam: The Aegean Sea lies between which two countries? | Norway and Sweden | *Greece and Turkey | France and Spain | Italy and Egypt
